            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[v0.2.5: Sissy updates itself

- Sissy checks for new versions on its own and installs one only when you
  say so. The controls sit at the foot of About: the current version, a
  Check for Updates button, and a switch for automatic checks.
- Updates are signed and notarized, and Sissy verifies each one before
  installing it.
- This is the last version you install by hand: 0.2.4 cannot update
  itself, so download 0.2.5 once and later versions arrive through Sissy.
- About's links stay blue and the sheet ends on the copyright line.
]]></description>
